flowchart TD
    A[State-mutating operation] --> B[Durable source state / transaction]
    B --> C[Apply mutations]
    C --> D{Injected fault}
    D --> E[Restart / resume / observe failure]
    E --> F[Read durable commit marker]
    F --> G[Read fresh actual Windows / client state]
    G --> H{Target committed durably?}
    H -->|No| I[Source remains canonical]
    I --> J[Rollback / reconcile source]
    H -->|Yes| K[Target remains canonical]
    K --> L[Repair / reconcile target]
    J --> M{Verification passes?}
    L --> M
    M -->|Yes| N[Coherent verified state]
    M -->|No| O[Recovery Coordination]
    O --> P[Apply bounded recovery]
    P --> Q[Read actual state]
    Q --> R{Recovery verified?}
    R -->|Yes| N
    R -->|No| S[Safe degraded / manual repair / Windows recovery]
